VALUES (NULL, (SELECT id FROM topics WHERE name = $q$Auditing Theory$q$ LIMIT 1), $q$An auditor estimates the rate of deviation from an internal control procedure. Which sampling type is primarily applicable?$q$, $q$multiple_choice$q$, $j$[{"label": "A", "text": "Analytical sampling", "is_correct": false}, {"label": "B", "text": "Attribute sampling", "is_correct": true}, {"label": "C", "text": "Variables sampling", "is_correct": false}, {"label": "D", "text": "Monetary-unit valuation only", "is_correct": false}]$j$::jsonb, $q$B$q$, $q$A$q$, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, $q$medium$q$, $q$"Attribute sampling estimates a population characteristic such as a control deviation rate and is primarily used for tests of controls. Variables sampling estimates numerical amounts."

